{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-intuition","title":"物理直觉与方法","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/ideas-and-methods/physical-intuition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thinking-with-pictures","title":"用图像思考","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/ideas-and-methods/physical-intuition/thinking-with-pictures","wordCount":1593,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"reconstructing-from-first-principles","title":"从第一性原理重建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/ideas-and-methods/physical-intuition/reconstructing-from-first-principles","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 物理直觉与方法\n\n本章剖析费曼最为人称道的特质：非凡的物理直觉。这种直觉并非天生的神秘禀赋，而是建立在一套可被理解的方法之上——用图像思考，并从第一性原理重建知识。\n\n第一篇文档讲述他\"用图像思考\"的习惯：把抽象的数学转化为可视化的物理图景，从而直接\"看见\"问题的本质。第二篇文档讲述他拒绝死记硬背、坚持从基本原理亲手重新推导一切的治学方式。\n"}